!episodes/cast-cyber-girl/closeup/parkour/layers/*
!episodes/cast-cyber-girl/closeup/c3v7/*
!episodes/cast-cyber-girl/closeup/c2tape/k[135].png
!episodes/cast-cyber-girl/closeup/c2tape/k4?.png
# 舞台大屏素材库只留定稿用到的 9 段（片段清单 clips.json 和 README 照常入库）
!episodes/cast-cyber-girl/closeup/screen-clips/clap/*
!episodes/cast-cyber-girl/closeup/screen-clips/face/*
!episodes/cast-cyber-girl/closeup/screen-clips/hairflip/*
