!episodes/cast-cyber-girl/closeup/screen-clips/mic-half/*
!episodes/cast-cyber-girl/closeup/screen-clips/point/*
!episodes/cast-cyber-girl/closeup/screen-clips/profile/*
# MV 分段素材：副歌 1 的 i2v 序列和 2D 切图、尾声的 i2v 序列和直播信息流
!episodes/mv-pdoom/fresh/c1-v4/i2v/*
!episodes/mv-pdoom/fresh/c1-v4/k2d*/cut-*.png
!episodes/mv-pdoom/fresh/v4-rest/c4/entry-*-1080.png
!episodes/mv-pdoom/fresh/v4-rest/c4/feed/**
!episodes/mv-pdoom/fresh/v4-rest/c4/i2v/**
# three.js 场景部件的贴图：表情贴花（只留定稿用到的几个偏航角）、超立方体图集
!episodes/mv-pdoom/kits/tesseract-atlas.jpg
!episodes/mv-pdoom/kits/face-decals/*
